#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:21
#: 84c15c511161458f84b93507a9eb912c
msgid ""
"可以直接增加 `review_status=checked` 这类追踪标签。若要替换 `Config_type`，先删除旧的 "
"`Config_type`，再增加新的值，例如 `Config_type=reviewed_bulk`。确认后，同一组修改会应用到所有选中结构。"
msgstr ""
"You can directly add a tracking tag such as `review_status=checked`. To "
"replace `Config_type`, remove the old `Config_type` first and then add the "
"new value, for example `Config_type=reviewed_bulk`. The same edits are "
"applied to every selected structure when you confirm."

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:23
#: a2da2aa232e3495b92ebbc9978a6d333
msgid "立即核对结果"
msgstr "Verify the Result Immediately"

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:25
#: a43dba1163b741e988434f7b122aeb43
msgid "三个结构的 Config_type 已批量更新"
msgstr "Config_type updated on three structures"

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:25
#: a43dba1163b741e988434f7b122aeb43
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/edit_metadata_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/edit_metadata_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:30
#: e869354519084d41ad54c56c0854c25d
msgid "右侧信息栏应显示新值，底部仍应是 `Sel: 3`。元数据编辑没有独立撤销操作，批量修改前最好保留原文件。"
msgstr ""
"The information panel on the right should show the new value, while the "
"status bar should still show `Sel: 3`. Metadata editing has no dedicated "
"undo action, so keep the original file before making bulk changes."

#: ../../source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:32
#: a26adb032c9e4c30baaa159312bd2d29
msgid ""
"`Config_type` "
"应表示真正有意义的分组，例如不同计算软件或明确的数据阶段。不要给每个结构随意创建一个新组；在能量基线平移等操作中，过细分组反而会引入不稳定的独立基线。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` should represent a meaningful group, such as a calculation "
"code or a clearly defined data stage. Do not create an arbitrary group for "
"every structure. In operations such as energy baseline shifting, overly fine"
" groups can introduce unstable independent baselines."
